<title>PORTUGAL: SOCCER-RONALDO, SHEARER, WEAH CONTEST FIFA WORLD PLAYER OF YEAR.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RONALDO, SHEARER, WEAH CONTEST FIFA WORLD PLAYER OF YEAR.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barcelona's Ronaldo, Alan Shearer of Newcastle and AC Milan's George Weah, last year's winner, were named on Wednesday as the three candidates for FIFA's world footballer of the year award.</p>
<p>The three gained most votes in a poll of 100 national team coaches, FIFA, soccer's world governing body, announced at a news conference.</p>
<p>The winner will be named at a ceremony in Lisbon on January 20.</p>
</text>
